  startNode: start
  nodes:
  - id: start
    line: They say the view from the mezzanine is better. They're right.
    choices:
    - text: Why eat here then?
      next: topic
    - text: See you around.
      next: bye
  - id: topic
    line: Because the food is here and the view doesn't fit on a tray.
    choices:
    - text: Ask something else.
      next: start
    - text: Take care.
      next: bye
  - id: bye
    line: Bye now.
    choices: []
